	(text "MCU-09  Wi-Fi / OTA 备用接口\n本版不装配，已排除 PCB / BOM。\n原理图及 PD8 / PD9 连接保留。\nPD8 / 55：USART2_TX；PD9 / 56：USART2_RX。\n原设计使用 USART2 全重映射。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 357 193 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "827dbb93-91b9-4176-80bb-279f25d751a3")
	)
	(text "PWM 网络       GPIO / 脚号       定时器通道\nPWM1          PC6 / 63          TIMER7_CH0\nPWM2          PC7 / 64          TIMER7_CH1\nPWM3          PC8 / 65          TIMER7_CH2\nPWM4          PC9 / 66          TIMER7_CH3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 207.01 232.41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9a958ea6-3f80-521f-bd5e-8fbec7dd1247")
	)
	(text "MCU-04  USB / 电机子页接口"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254 26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "宋体")
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a4909303-4bac-4d48-bebc-bc2274b39540")
	)
	(text "MCU-02  时钟 / 启动 / 调试"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16 177 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "宋体")
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b0127e29-e62f-4c2f-b74e-5c4992fd17cc")
	)
	(text "MCU-01｜+3V3 供电与各电源引脚旁路。\nD8 为 VBAT 供电选择支路。\nB01 / C37 / C38 为备用区域，当前 DNP。\n\nMCU-02｜Y1：主时钟；Y2：低速时钟。\nJP1 / JP2：BOOT 配置；SW1：手动复位。\nR17 / C39：NRST 上拉与滤波。\nH5：SWD 下载 / 调试接口。\n\nMCU-05｜U8：GD25Q16 SPI Flash。\nR18 / R19 / R20 保持控制脚默认电平；C40 去耦。\n\n电机使能｜Motor_start 输出至电机页 U15.OE。\n高电平允许 PWM 电平转换；低电平关闭。\n此处没有硬件锁存，需 MCU 持续维持使能。\n\n四路电机｜PWM1～4、DIR1～4、BRAKE1～4 为控制输出；\nFG1～4 为测速输入，按电机通道编号对应。\n\nPWM1~4: PC6~PC9 / TIMER7_CH0~CH3.\nPD12~PD15: NC / reserved.\nFirmware still uses TIMER3; update before use."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 350 105 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "宋体")
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cda3c98e-796b-4f8f-9b8d-c7f8117b9f6d")
	)
	(text "MCU-01  供电与去耦"
